Arara Code: count changes across all workspace repositories in the SCM badge.

Why a patch: scm.countBadge=all currently counts only visible repositories.
Neither the stable nor proposed extension API exposes the built-in SCM activity
badge or changes its repository selection. Use the SCM service's full repository
collection, observing additions/removals and preserving focused/off modes.
Touches: src/vs/workbench/contrib/scm/browser/activity.ts

